# The books, the reference screenshots, and the ignore rules for what Bloom regenerates inside a
# book folder all live in the inputs repository now
# (https://github.com/BloomBooks/bloom-testing-inputs), which this project fetches into
# output/testing-inputs (gitignored at the repository root). So nothing about the test collections
# needs ignoring here.

